Description: brave-os touch layer for tablets and 2-in-1s
 Activates only when a touchscreen is present (or when forced in Settings >
 Touch): on-screen keyboard (squeekboard) in tablet mode, automatic screen
 rotation from the accelerometer, a 2x default scale on 3000 px wide panels,
 and touch-friendly browser flags. Machines without a touchscreen are not
 affected. Ships in the image from build 9 and updates through the brave-os
 repository.
